# CI settings for verify-examples.yaml (see examples/TEMPLATE.md).
# Nothing to build: both MCP modes run MCP_SERVER_IMAGE, which CI sets to this commit's image, and
# the defaults (20 minutes, no JDK) are enough. The stdio service is in the "stdio" Compose profile,
# so `up` does not start it; demo.sh runs it with `docker compose run`.
